      "created_at": "2018-02-13T03:02:09.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>A non-persistent boost can cancel out a persistent hinder, and a non-persistent hinder can cancel out a persistent boost.&nbsp; I think that's the only reason other than RP.</p>",
